+  already written, so a failure there costs signal rather than data.
+
+  WHY MR6 IS THE ONE THAT CAN BREAK PROD, and how that risk was retired rather than asserted.
+  `persist_docs` pushes every description into BigQuery, which hard-rejects a column description
+  over 1,024 characters and a relation description over 16,384. The approved plan recorded 15
+  descriptions over 1,024, which is the whole reason MR6 was sequenced behind MR2-MR4.
